{"name":"Black-framed glass sliding doors, Haringey (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (10 Oct 2026) from the job photos at standard sizes (nothing measured): a 2800 wide opening, 2400 to the ceiling. Four black-framed glass panels 720 wide x 2320 high (40 mm frame, two bars across a little below the middle), hung from a black double track at the ceiling: the two outer panels fixed in the back channel, the two middle ones slide out in front of them. Above the track, timber fixed between the steel ceiling joists along the line of the doors, and the ceiling closed up under it with a strip of plasterboard. Side walls and steel joists are room context. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X along the opening, Y through it, Z up.","materials":{"Wall":{"color":[236,234,228],"roughness":0.95},"Room: steel joist":{"color":[160,164,170],"roughness":0.45,"metalness":0.6},"Timber":{"color":[204,174,124],"roughness":0.85},"Plasterboard":{"color":[232,232,228],"roughness":0.9},"Frame, black":{"color":[28,29,31],"roughness":0.5,"metalness":0.3},"Glass":{"color":[200,222,232],"roughness":0.1,"opacity":0.2}},"moves":{"Panel 2 (slides left): Frame":{"slide":{"offset":[-640,0,0]},"at":[0.0,0.9],"with":["Panel 2 (slides left): Glass, bottom","Panel 2 (slides left): Glass, middle","Panel 2 (slides left): Glass, top"]},"Panel 3 (slides right): Frame":{"slide":{"offset":[640,0,0]},"at":[0.1,1.0],"with":["Panel 3 (slides right): Glass, bottom","Panel 3 (slides right): Glass, middle","Panel 3 (slides right): Glass, top"]}},"view":{"yaw":-0.35,"pitch":0.25,"yawMin":-1.1,"yawMax":1.1,"pitchMin":0.0,"pitchMax":1.1},"actions":{"open":"Slide the doors open","close":"Slide them shut"},"secs":1.6,"geoms":{"g0":{"v":[-150,-300,0,-150,300,0,0,300,0,0,-300,0,-150,-300,2400,0,-300,2400,0,300,2400,-150,300,2400],"f":[[[0,1,2,3]],[[4,5,6,7]],[[0,3,5,4]],[[3,2,6,5]],[[2,1,7,6]],[[1,0,4,7]]],"e":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,0],[4,5],[5,6],[6,7],[7,4],[3,